	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "SG90 bottom-case board outline, motor-on-board design. Case 23 x 12mm outer, 1mm shell -> cavity 21 x 10mm; board 20.6 x 9.6mm with 0.2mm clearance per side. 45deg corner chamfers 2.8mm legs clear the round screw columns (face 3.5mm diagonal from outer corner tip). Target cross = motor center at x=5.5 (can apex against +x end wall); place SG90_Motor there. +x end = motor end wall.")
